[I] CPU and memory usage library

[T] A library that fetches information about the running system such as
[T] cpu and memory usage, active processes etc.
[T]
[T] On Linux systems, these information are taken directly from the /proc
[T] filesystem while on other systems a server is used to read those
[T] information from /dev/kmem or whatever.

